# Used only by `npm run dev` (Vite's local dev server on :5173) so it keeps
# talking to a separately-run backend on :8000, exactly as before. The
# production build (used by the packaged desktop app, which serves the
# frontend and API from the same origin) intentionally does not set this —
# see src/api.ts.
VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
